ic","site_admin":false},"body":"Terminan has no admitted Sync Control API at the inspected source pins. This adds an isolated read-only snapshot/event consumer, bounded cursor/resync/reconnect state machine and additive static UI that remains UNAVAILABLE with all commands disabled. Existing runtime, server routes, auth gates and backend job lifecycle are unchanged.\n\nBase: PR68 7ed3708df53c8850fd11fc8331440bdfee99aa3e / tree 96963f7e749e73c8c81e7650bdee4f2a0a05923a, approved by Integration Owner. All 23 files are additive in the approved sync/UI/test/docs/workflow scope. Preview: `python terminan/sync/serve.py --port 8896`, then `/sync.html`.\n\nCurrent HEAD: 166b85e888d7d0ade24bd945761ad501a94e060c; tree fcf075bbd41a7fa951c115374681b3392a7a4537.\n\nValidation: 42 deterministic Node consumer/client tests passed, including the 25 requested model scenarios and dataset session/quorum/reconnect/late-request/buffer/freshness regressions. Three JSON schemas passed Draft202012 meta-schema and positive/negative fixture validation. Three local Chromium tests passed; desktop/mobile screenshots were visually inspected and unchanged in repeat comparison. Windows/Linux CI is queued, not PASS.\n\nFull Python suite before and after: 441 tests, 1 failure, 16 errors, 1 skipped; identical 17 failure/error IDs require missing pinned source checkouts and upstream integration.source_guard. The full suite is not green.\n\nAgent 2 ACK is consumer direction only; actual Sync routes, human provider/RBAC, read barrier/order, retention and freshness guarantees remain unavailable/pending. Agent 7 read-only results lack agreed Sync metadata binding. Model fixtures do not qualify real leader failover, PC relocation, backend authorization or job durability. Runtime/Windows six-node/physical acceptance NOT_RUN; overall NO-GO. No merge, production deployment or physical actions requested.\n\nSee docs/sync/README.md for dependency ACK matrix, scope, test commands and P0/P1/P2. Schemas remain proposals; there is no competing backend or authority.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-06T15:47:32Z","updated_at":"2026-11-06T15:51:01Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c04569853c8df8387a88c6ad3ae347d9e951f7be","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"YehorBabenko88:feature/terminan-sync-v1-20261106","ref":"feature/terminan-sync-v1-20261106","repo":{"id":1413341784,"node_id":"R_kgDOVD3iWA","name":"Terminan","full_name":"YehorBabenko88/Terminan","owner":{"login":"YehorBabenko88","id":304050327,"node_id":"U_kgDOEh9wlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/304050327?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88","html_url":"https://github.com/YehorBabenko88","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":null,"homepage":null,"language":"Python","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"watchers":0,"open_issues_count":69,"open_issues":69,"size":1112,"default_branch":"main","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_downloads":false,"has_di